}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Section 1.4 - the group law on y^2 = x^3 + 17", "Subsection",ExpressionUUID->"aecc2327-c851-41f1-b19b-687af0bc3df4"],

Cell["\<\
With P1 = (-1, 4) and P2 = (2, 5) the book finds P1 + P2 = (-8/9, -109/27) \
and 2P1 = (137/64, -2651/512).\
\>", "Text",ExpressionUUID->"89be79dc-02d2-4d4e-920b-1721229a5621"],

